## Discovery

### mDNS (Bonjour)

{
 discovery: {
 mdns: {
 mode: "minimal", // minimal | full | off
 },
 },
}

- minimal (default): omit cliPath + sshPort from TXT records.

- full: include cliPath + sshPort.

- Hostname defaults to openclaw. Override with OPENCLAW_MDNS_HOSTNAME.

### Wide-area (DNS-SD)

{
